<title>POLAND: BRE OCT NET RISES TO PLN 12.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BRE OCT NET RISES TO PLN 12.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 12.19 vs    8.85</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   16.84 vs   13.52</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 26.49 vs   25.22</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	44.11 vs   35.70</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					116.91 vs   84.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  172.96 vs  139.38</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		271.08 vs  227.82</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     405.05 vs  298.74</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Rozwoju Eksportu</p>
<p>SA. In October the bank received a tax deduction for investment</p>
<p>of 7.99 million zlotys. </p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
